/target

# .NET build artifacts (csindex + its test fixture)
obj/
bin/
# ...but crates/rvl/src/bin is SOURCE: it holds the cindex and rustindex bin
# targets, which must be bins of the rvl package for release packaging to pack
# them beside rvl (see the RELEASE PACKAGING note in crates/rvl/Cargo.toml).
# Without this negation `bin/` above silently drops them from every commit, and
# the release fails with "failed to find bin cindex for .../crates/rvl".
!crates/rvl/src/bin/
